        "content": "# n8n-Workflow-Github-Backup",
        "height": 1443,
        "width": 3270,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c56fbc0b-2c0f-4d5c-8ea2-6b98ded8b962",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -432,
        112
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📋 WORKFLOW SUMMARY\n\n**Purpose:** Automatically backup n8n workflows to GitHub\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Trigger (Schedule/Manual)\n2. Get/Create index.json in GitHub\n3. Fetch all n8n workflows\n4. Compare with GitHub index\n5. Create/Edit/Delete files as needed\n6. Update index.json\n\n\n**Features:**\n- Daily automatic backups (7 PM)\n- Detects new, edited, renamed, and deleted workflows\n- Maintains an index for tracking\n- Smart comparison to avoid unnecessary commits",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 512,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "3de6e86c-72ab-4314-80aa-c9c853446ce2",
      "name": "Workflow Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -976,
        960
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ SETUP REQUIREMENTS\n\n**1️⃣ GitHub OAuth Credentials**\n- Go to *Credentials → New → GitHub OAuth2*\n- Create GitHub OAuth App:\n  - Settings → Developer settings → OAuth Apps\n  - Authorization callback URL: your n8n instance\n  - Enter Client ID & Secret in n8n\n\n\n**2️⃣ GitHub Repository**\n- Create a new repository (public/private)\n- Copy repository owner and name\n\n\n**3️⃣ Configure Workflow**\n- Edit \"Set Github Data\" node:\n  - `repo_owner`: your GitHub username\n  - `repo_name`: your repository name\n- Connect GitHub OAuth credentials to all GitHub nodes\n\n\n**4️⃣ n8n API Credentials**\n- Go to *Settings → API*\n- Create new API key\n- Add as n8n credential in workflow\n\n✅ Test manually before enabling schedule",
        "height": 608,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "af54072c-833b-4ba5-a977-50be925c1691",
      "name": "Setup Requirements",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -976,
        304
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📂 INDEX SYSTEM\n\n**index.json structure:**\n```json\n{\n  \"workflow_id_1\": {\n    \"name\": \"Workflow Name\",\n    \"file_path\": \"workflows/Workflow Name.json\"\n  },\n  \"workflow_id_2\": { ... }\n}\n```\n\n**Purpose:**\n- Tracks which workflows exist in GitHub\n- Maps workflow IDs to file paths\n- Enables detection of renames and deletes\n\n**First Run:**\n- If index.json doesn't exist, it's created automatically\n- 3-second wait allows file creation to complete",
        "height": 472,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "46d253f7-f722-4532-8b1c-a11ea9f78a3b",
      "name": "Index System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        336,
        1040
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔍 C,E,D CHECKER\n\n**Compare & Decision Logic:**\n\nFor each n8n workflow:\n- **CREATE:** New workflow not in index\n- **RENAME:** Workflow name changed\n  - Deletes old file\n  - Creates new file with new name\n- **EDIT:** Existing workflow (checked later for actual changes)\n\n\nFor workflows in index but not in n8n:\n- **DELETE:** Workflow removed from n8n\n\n\nFor index itself:\n- **UPDATE INDEX:** If any changes detected\n\n**Output:** Array of actions to take",
        "height": 456,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "bb13aaa8-797d-4692-8fc3-c5af4762dd0a",
      "name": "C,E,D Checker Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        512,
        160
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔀 SWITCH ROUTING\n\nRoutes items based on status:\n\n**Create Branch:**\n- New workflows → Create New Files\n\n\n**Edit Branch:**\n- Existing workflows → Smart edit check\n- Fetches GitHub version\n- Compares with n8n version\n- Only commits if actually different\n\n\n**Delete Branch:**\n- Removed workflows → Delete Files\n\n\n**Update Index Branch:**\n- Index changed → Update Index File\n\n\nEach branch processes independently.",
        "height": 496,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "676100b1-a511-431c-b4b1-e1a34c57d79d",
      "name": "Switch Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        832,
        1024
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✏️ SMART EDIT DETECTION\n\n**Why needed:**\n- n8n changes timestamps/metadata on save\n- Prevents unnecessary commits\n\n\n**Process:**\n1. Fetch current file from GitHub\n2. Parse both GitHub & n8n versions\n3. Normalize JSON (sort keys)\n4. Compare stringified versions\n5. Only commit if truly different\n\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Cleaner commit history\n- No spam commits\n- Saves GitHub API calls",
        "height": 428,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "00e4020f-7493-4b2d-bbd3-c595d0be1bd1",
      "name": "Smart Edit Detection",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2160,
        720
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📝 COMMIT MESSAGES\n\nAuto-generated commit messages:\n\n**Format:** `[Workflow Name] ([Action]) YYYY-MM-DD`\n\n**Examples:**\n- `My Workflow (Created) 2026-01-15`\n- `My Workflow (Edited) 2026-01-15`\n- `My Workflow (Deleted) 2026-01-15`\n- `Index (Edited) 2026-01-15`\n\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Clear action history\n- Easy to track changes\n- Searchable by date",
        "height": 404,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b0a51055-0407-4ec8-9538-b0c6d4f56337",
      "name": "Commit Messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
