    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔄 HOW IT WORKS\n\n**Sequential Processing:**\n- Loops through files one at a time\n- Downloads JSON from GitHub\n- Creates workflow in n8n\n- Prevents conflicts and rate limits\n\n**Error Handling:**\n- If `workflows/` folder not found → stops gracefully\n- Ensure backup workflow ran at least once first",
